\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Hendrik\cell I'll warrant the monsters have not yet reached the Last Bastion.\par
\par
This gives us time to strike down the fiend who has plunged our land into darkness. Let us seize our chance!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Where is everyone? Where is His Majesty? Surely they cannot have fled the encampment?\par
\par
Come, we must search for them. I fear something may be amiss...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1210\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell That was a most raucous celebration. I have not seen our people smile and laugh like that for a long time. But then it is not everyday that light returns to our world.\par
\par
Now, I must bid farewell to His Majesty before we depart.\par
\par
Perhaps you should speak to your mother and all those who are dear to you, <pc>. Who knows when you might see them again?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Know that I am your sword, your shield, your unswerving companion. I will stand by you until peace is restored to our world.\par
\par
You are the Luminary, the bringer of hope. You have a long road ahead of you, but it is one you shall not walk alone.\par
\par
Now, let us heed His Majesty's words and journey to the holy mountain of Pang Lai.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I heard the Mayor of Cobblestone speak of the significance the Tor has for the villagers.\par
\par
As I understand it, it is where your prayers reach the Spirit of the Land.\par
\par
Would that my own prayers could also be answered...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I heard the Mayor of Cobblestone speak of the significance the Tor has for the villagers.\par
\par
As I understand it, it is where your prayers reach the Spirit of the Land.\par
\par
Would that my own prayers could also be answered...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell You need not fear for your mother, or your fellow villagers. His Majesty has vowed to protect them, and protect them he will.\par
\par
Instead we must stay focused on our task\emdash entering the castle.\par
\par
Come, let us first traverse the Manglegrove.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell We must strike down that foul usurper without delay! To the castle!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Come, let us return to the Last Bastion without delay. We must inform the King of Jasper's treachery.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh907\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Let us head west through the Manglegrove to the Costa Valor.\par
\par
According to His Majesty, we must pass through the checkpoint beyond it in order to reach Mount Pang Lai.\par
\par
I do not know what relation those who dwell there have to the destiny of the Luminary, but we must find out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Our destination is Heliodor Castle. I trust you have not forgotten where it is, <pc>?\par
\par
We must traverse the Manglegrove which lies to the west, and gain access to the castle sewers from there. Come, time is short.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Your mother was most eager that I ensure your safety, <pc>...\par
\par
We should head back to the Last Bastion without delay. Wandering any further afield will only invite trouble.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh605\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Obsidian is particularly fond of the grass in this region. Once he starts to graze upon it, it is difficult to rouse him to depart.\par
\par
Indeed, he would always make time for this grass, even when we were pursuing you. In hindsight, perhaps that was no bad thing...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Once we traverse this forest, we will reach the hill from where we can enter the castle. But beware\emdash monsters will no doubt seek to strike us under cover of darkness.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell We have no reason to linger in this forest. We must return to the castle at once and carry out our mission.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Loath as I am to admit it, the truth is that I harbour an intense dislike of insects of all kinds.\par
\par
I would be grateful if we could return to the Last Bastion without passing through the Manglegrove...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Loath as I am to admit it, the truth is that I harbour an intense dislike of insects of all kinds.\par
\par
I would be grateful if we could head west of here and make haste for the Costa Valor.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I understand that when you and that blue-haired thief were fleeing the dungeons, you leapt from a cliff in order to make good your escape.\par
\par
How you survived, I do not know. Now it is time for us to retrace your footsteps and gain access to the sewers from that cliff.\par
\par
Come, we must search for a path up to the cliff\emdash and let us hope that the dragon that dwells in the caves is asleep...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell How long has it been since one could look up and see the sun? How long since I looked up at the sky at all...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell To reach the Costa Valor, we will need to head west through the Manglegrove.\par
\par
It lies to the south of this hill. Let us make it our first port of call.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell If my memory serves me correctly, there are no tunnels that lead directly to the throne room. We must head above ground.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Though I grew up in the castle, I rarely ventured into these tunnels.\par
\par
As such, I am afraid I do not know where the gate His Majesty spoke of is located.\par
\par
All I know is that it will likely be marked with the royal crest. Come, let us search every corner of the sewers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell There is a staircase that leads to the King's chambers behind a cupboard in the kitchen. From there, we can access the throne room.\par
\par
Come, let us head into the castle.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It seems a shame to be down here in the gloom now that the skies are bright once more.\par
\par
Let us return to the Last Bastion, <pc>. His Majesty awaits us.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I know that we were but pawns in the Lord of Shadows' game, but it pains me still to think that I was responsible for your incarceration in the dungeons. I am sorry...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The darkness which blotted out the sun appeared to emanate from the castle.\par
\par
I sense that the foul beast responsible for it is close at hand. We must enter the castle without delay.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Come, let us find another way to enter the throne room. The usurper will be there, if he is anywhere. He will pay for defiling the noble crown of Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The darkness which blotted out the sun appeared to emanate from the castle.\par
\par
I sense that the foul beast responsible for it is close at hand. We must head to the upper floors.\par
\par
Ah, but it pains me to see my beloved castle in such a state of disrepair. The foul beasts who did this will pay!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell You have a curious power, <pc>. Whenever I am with you, hope seems to dawn upon us, like sunlight breaking through the clouds.\par
\par
I do not know who or what awaits us in the throne room, but I know what we have to do.\par
\par
We must strike down the foul usurper and bring the light back to this realm. I will allow nothing to stand in our way.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The kitchen is on the north side of the castle. Once there, we must access a staircase concealed behind a cupboard.\par
\par
That will allow us to reach the throne room. Come, <pc>, let us not tarry any further.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The castle is in a terrible state of disrepair. It will be a very long time before it is fit for royal habitation once again.\par
\par
Princess Jade would be deeply distressed if she were to see what has become of her home.\par
\par
No one cherished the beauty of Heliodor more than her...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Once peace returns to our world, Heliodor must be rebuilt. I will not rest until the kingdom that raised me is restored to its full splendour.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell All I know of this place, I learnt from a boyhood companion. He would read endless books about the kingdom's history...\par
\par
...But that is no longer of any significance. All that matters is that we gain access to the castle.\par
\par
We must traverse the Manglegrove and enter the castle through the sewers. Come, we have no time to lose.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell That vision the tree showed us was an episode from my youth. I had forgotten all about it...\par
\par
It seems that this is the power of the Luminary. You are able to draw on the memories amassed within the World Tree and pry into others' pasts...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
