\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell You may have been separated from your companions, <pc>, but I believe they must be out there somewhere.\par
\par
We cannot dwell on that now, however. We must proceed to Mount Pang Lai. With luck we will find the power to defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell This place reminds me of my youth. I spent some time in a town in this region...\par
\par
But that is of no consequence now\emdash the King has instructed us to travel to Mount Pang Lai, and seek those whose fate is deeply intertwined with that of the Luminary.\par
\par
We need to head north and find the checkpoint of which His Majesty spoke. Come, let us go there without delay.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Could the inhabitants of Angri-La be the people His Majesty spoke of? Could they hold the key to defeating the Lord of Shadows?\par
\par
Hmm... Alas, this is no time for idle speculation\emdash let us go there and find out more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Those who dwell on Mount Pang Lai are said to have some deep connection with the Luminary.\par
\par
Let us climb to the mountain's peak and see if there is one who can teach us how to defeat the Lord of Shadows.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell That young monk divined your true identity with a single glance, <pc>. His Majesty was not wrong\emdash the people here must surely possess some powerful connection to the Luminary.\par
\par
We should do as he suggests and join him in the High Hall at the top of the temple.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh1162\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell How long has it been since I last came to Puerto Valor? It has certainly been many a moon since I honed my sword skills under the formidable Don Rodrigo, the lord of this domain.\par
\par
We trained every day, from morning until night, the vast ocean below us. Watching those endless roiling waves taught me much about the harshness of nature.\par
\par
But this is not the town I once knew. Its people are cowed by the Lord of Shadows. I will not rest until that fear is banished from the land.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell This town has changed greatly since I came here as a young man. Building a casino here would have been unthinkable back then...\par
\par
I have no interest in such places\emdash do what you have to do and then let us leave.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I confess, this Sylvando fellow is rather impressive. There are not many who could command such devotion.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
