\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Accursed Mordegon... His shadow has fallen here too, and rendered it barely recognisable...\par
\par
We must learn how to defeat the Lord of Shadows, and to that end we must travel to Mount Pang Lai. Let us delay no longer.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
