\par
I have no idea who he is, but he must have a very good reason for coming here...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The High Lama can perform a rite which will transport us to the place between worlds. That appears to be our only option at the moment.\par
\par
We should not tarry here. He awaits us at the top of the mountain.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
