\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell You say Lord Robert is alive and well, but he remains trapped within the void. You must bring him back.\par
\par
We should not tarry here. The High Lama awaits you at the top of the mountain. It is time to return to the place between worlds...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10352 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Lord Robert will prove an invaluable ally. After all, he has learnt one of the supreme skills performed by the legendary wizard Morcant.\par
\par
